ividual Vtuber on YouTube.\n\nI would like to use your illustration as a wallpaper present for YouTube membership subscribers.\n\nDetails of the request\nIllustration to be used as a wallpaper present\nI would like an illustration of Halloween.\nI will leave the body pose, atmosphere, and clothing up to you.\nThe background is also up to you.\nPlease use a winking or other expression around the eyes without closing one eye.\n\nStanding drawing of Nekozuki: https://f.yourl.jp/9a2d542e/\n↓Character's characteristics\nHer hair is brown. Hair color is brown with orange-brown tips.\nHer bangs are partially cut at an angle.\nEyes are yellow and pink-purple.\nShe has yellow ribbon accessories under her cat ears.\n\nThank you in advance for your time.", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@puwawa_xxx/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2370868, "client_id": 2345114, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/82688502/uploads/origins/65f8c771-8f83-4921-9a08-68bb6d95a38d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=403189782ba5c4199cd71a1e9a07d86e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/82688502/uploads/origins/65f8c771-8f83-4921-9a08-68bb6d95a38d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=403189782ba5c4199cd71a1e9a07d86e, https://si.imgix.net/82688502/uploads/origins/65f8c771-8f83-4921-9a08-68bb6d95a38d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=293e2157ef43f45ed8bc1c01eda28dcb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/82688502/uploads/origins/65f8c771-8f83-4921-9a08-68bb6d95a38d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d15169c11bef99db3ed17826334ba02b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/82688502/uploads/origins/65f8c